WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Food companies don't
want to satisfy you.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.850
They want to addict you.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.125
We have to resist that.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.670
This class is not about learning
some short-term new diet.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.980
This is really about
a sustainable way

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.570
of eating long term.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.740
I have written about
agriculture, nutrition,

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.070
cooking, and this is
everything I know about food.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.520
The best wisdom we have can
be reduced to seven words,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:32.890
eat food, not too
much, mostly plants.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:35.500
This is MasterClass.

